  "hints": [
    "Think about a sliding window that includes the current row plus one neighbor on each side.",
    "Use a window function with PARTITION BY user_id ORDER BY posted_at and a ROWS BETWEEN frame that specifies 1 PRECEDING and 1 FOLLOWING.",
